      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "DATABASE LAYER\n\n🗄️ Firebird Database\n\n📊 Main Tables:\n- FFBSCANNERDATA[MM]\n  (Jan-Dec)\n\n👥 Reference Tables:\n- EMP (Employee)\n- OCFIELD (Fields)\n- CRDIVISION (Divisions)\n\n🔗 Connection:\n- firebird_connector.py\n- ISQL Interface",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "KsZd5Jb2tFb88Dil6YWYj",
      "originalText": "DATABASE LAYER\n\n🗄️ Firebird Database\n\n📊 Main Tables:\n- FFBSCANNERDATA[MM]\n  (Jan-Dec)\n\n👥 Reference Tables:\n- EMP (Employee)\n- OCFIELD (Fields)\n- CRDIVISION (Divisions)\n\n🔗 Connection:\n- firebird_connector.py\n- ISQL Interface",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 277
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 85,
      "versionNonce": 535407619,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "6Mbpl4_C_Lx9tb7r-tVuc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 3035.9863673926006,
      "y": 297.6762204336385,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "width": 300,
      "height": 423,
